The reconstruction implementation and numerical tests originate from the
behav3d_sense package of SDU-CREATE-BEHAV3D/behav3d_ws, commit
40d99a046e584f4705a49c1044d4fc47bf7f079c. That package declares the MIT license
in src/behav3d_sense/package.xml.

Original module mapping:
  reconstruct/TSDF_cpu_cropped.py -> offline_reconstruction/fusion.py
  reconstruct/color_to_depth.py -> offline_reconstruction/color_to_depth.py
  reconstruct/utils/* -> offline_reconstruction/utils/*

Adaptations: explicit output paths, configurable fusion/color parameters,
offline input discovery and validation, batch execution, confidence PLY
export, CPU previews, and standalone tests/documentation. Robot capture,
motion planning, ROS services and RViz publication are not included.
